
agentos: agents run here as transactions. Nothing they do is final until you commit it.

  agent doctor                    check this machine
  agent do "add a test for greet" give a task to an agent, in the current folder
  agent diff / commit / rollback  review what it did, keep it or drop it
  agent serve                     web console (or: systemctl --user enable --now agentd)

Claude Code isn't preinstalled:  curl -fsSL https://claude.ai/install.sh | bash
The OS updates atomically:       sudo bootc upgrade   (and sudo bootc rollback)

